Description:
   Installs the base classes to get you started with Commands, Contracts and Forms

Example:
    bin/rails generate business_logic:install

    This will install the files:
        app/business_logic/application_command.rb
        app/business_logic/application_contract.rb
        app/business_logic/application_form.rb
        spec/business_logic/generators_helper.rb

    And adds gems to your Gemfile:
        gem "ammeter", "~> 1.1", group: :test
        gem "dry-initializer", "~> 3.1"
        gem "dry-validation", "~> 1.10"
